    {
      "duration_ms": 11000,
      "caption": "Every queued call holds buffer space in the receiver's small mmap'd region.",
      "narration": "Every pending transaction holds a buffer in the receiver's roughly one megabyte mapping. Oneway calls are capped to about half of it, so a slow receiver fills it fast.",
      "elements": [
        {
          "id": "heading",
          "type": "title",
          "text": "The buffer budget",
          "x": 8,
